'''Test Page''' is a non-canonical article used to check wikitext rendering, infoboxes, citations, and section order. It is not a live VRChat feature.

== Description ==
The page exists only as a sandbox. Editors use it to confirm that wikitext features are working as expected.

A sample fact can sit after the sentence that needs a citation.<ref name="ask">[https://ask.vrchat.com Example Ask VRChat thread]; retrieved August 29, 2026.</ref>

